Sigzil Haight, the Shackled Prince, is a child of the [[Judge of Ages|Judge]] and a fiendish prince. His demesne is somewhere far out along the [[Infinite Horizon]].

His followers carry the smell of copper and brimstone. On the [[Geography/Star 221,325|Joker World at Star 221,325]], his servants hold [[Geography/The Quorum|the Quorum]], a structure reached only by answering its door. Among them are a mage and an enforcer, and a horde of [[Bestiary/Fiends|Hellions]]; [[Flintlock Toboggan]] is chained in one of its rooms. A fountain of blood in the Quorum's hall leads into the prince's demesne beyond.

He made the [[Org/The Scale/Voice of Many|Voice of Many]], a [[Hearts|Heart]], and kept it sealed in his demesne for centuries. It has since been freed and serves the Scale. One of his generals is the Keeper of Chains, a hulking, skull-faced figure in robes who wields a flaming greataxe and can point a finger and speak a killing word; the Voice of Many's escape blew him out of its chamber, and he lives. The Fixer, a demonic figure who came and went through the fountain of blood in the Quorum's hall, is dead.

He is the Shackle, one of four devils who have lately grown organized: himself, [[Divinity/Fiends/The Harlequin|the Harlequin]], the Hooded and the Loam.

The four are shown as four hands around one eye, the device of [[Divinity/The Eye|the Eye]] that woke them.
